    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="57">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 57</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Lafordes syrwunge. Gyf hwa embe kinincg syrwe oððe ymbe his hlaford, sy he his feores scyldig ⁊ ealles ðæs ðe he age, buton he ga to ðryfealdan ordale [⁊ þær clæne wyrþ].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Of plotting against a lord. If anyone plots against the king or against his own lord, he shall forfeit his life and all that he possesses, unless he goes to the triple ordeal and there proves himself innocent.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa ymb ciningc oððe hlaford syrwe, si he his feores scyldig ⁊ ealles þæs ðe he age, butan he ga to þryfealdan ordale.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
